---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I’m a Software Engineering student at TU Graz with a passion for building things that make a real impact.
    My journey started early — I gained university-level experience while still in secondary school, and since then,
    I’ve stayed driven by curiosity and challenge.<br>
    <br>
    Along the way, I’ve been recognized for academic excellence, graduating early with honours from high school and earning places in
    several scholarship programs. Beyond tech, I’ve learned a lot from working in banking, customer service, and athletics —
    experiences that taught me how to adapt quickly, stay focused, and balance multiple commitments without losing sight of quality.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Bachelor's Degree Software Engineering and Management"
      subtitle="2023 to now at Graz University of Technology, Styria, Austria"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Exchange Semester"
      subtitle="2025 at Rhodes College, Memphis, TN, U.S."
    />
    <TimeLineElement
        title="Auditor at University different courses during school"
        subtitle="2022 to 2023 at Graz University of Technology"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
        title="Middle School & High School"
        subtitle="2015 to 2023 at MS BG BRG Klusemannstrasse, Graz, Styria, Austria"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
        title="Primary School"
        subtitle="2011 to 2015 at Volksschule Stainz, Stainz, Stryia, Austria"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Student Teaching Assistant"
      subtitle="From October 2024 to June 2025 at Graz University of Technology, Graz, Styria, Austria"
    >
      Assisted in teaching and mentoring undergraduate students in Introduction to Structured Programming and Project
      Management in Software Development. Responsibilities included grading assignments, preparing and delivering tutorials,
      and providing guidance during programming exercises.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Data Quality Management"
      subtitle="From February 2024 to August 2024 at Raiffeisenbank Kalsdorf-Lieboch-Stainz, Lieboch, Styria, Austria"
    >
      The job included maintenance of customer data in the banking sector, support in data quality management and maintenance of
       Lotus Notes databases.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Reception Employee"
      subtitle="From August 2023 to December 2023 at FlibLab Center West, Graz, Styria, Austria"
    >
      Handled front-desk operations in a children’s entertainment facility, including managing bookings, payments, and
      customer inquiries. Developed strong communication and multitasking skills in a fast-paced, customer-facing environment.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
        title="Intern at Raiffeisenbank Kalsdorf-Lieboch-Stainz"
        subtitle="In July 2023 at Raiffeisenbank Kalsdorf-Lieboch-Stainz, Lieboch, Styria, Austria"
    >
      Gained first-hand experience in the banking sector through supporting marketing initiatives and assisting in
      back-office operations.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Relevant Coursework at Universities</div>
  </div> <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
  <TimeLineElement
      title="Operating Systems"
      subtitle="Developed a simplified operating system in C++, implementing low-level components such as user-space mutexes, thread management, shared memory, and process handling."
  />
  <TimeLineElement
      title="Object Oriented Programming 2"
      subtitle="Built an OpenStreetMap-based application using Java and Spring Boot, focusing on object-oriented design principles and clean architecture."
  />
  <TimeLineElement
      title="Agile Software Development & Project Management in Software Development"
      subtitle="Applied Scrum in team-based projects using Java and Angular, gaining hands-on experience in agile workflows, sprint planning, and collaboration tools."
  />
  <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior Software Development"
      subtitle="Led a full-stack team project using Django, applying design patterns and implementing effective testing strategies."
  />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Academic Achievements</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Recipient of the merit-based TU Graz 100 scholarship program 2023</li>
    <li>Recipient of the merit-based CSBME faculty scholarship 2023/24 for academic excellence</li>
    <li>Recipient of the merit-based AVL List scholarship for studying abroad in 2025</li>
    <li>Dean's list: Top 10% of 1st year students in Software Engineering & Management 2023/24</li>
    <li>Dean's list: Top 5% of 2nd year students in Software Engineering & Management 2024/25</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Projects</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/emtchy/obsidian-to-do-plugin" target="_blank"> Obsidian Plugin (Link to Repository)</a>
    </li>
    <!--<li>
      <a href="https://github.com/emtchy/emtchy.github.io" target="_blank"> Personal Website (Link to Repository)</a>
    </li>-->
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/emtchy/logo-sest" target="_blank">Logo Design for S&lt;st (Link to Repository)</a>
    </li>

  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>
    <ul class="list-none p-0 md:columns-5 columns-2 gap-6 [&_li]:break-inside-avoid">

      <li class="mb-5">
        <span class="text-l font-bold block mb-1">Frameworks &amp; Tools</span>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
          <li>GitHub</li>
          <li>GitLab</li>
          <li>Agile & Scrum</li>
          <li>Astro</li>
          <li>Spring Boot</li>
          <li>Django</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="mb-5">
        <span class="text-l font-bold block mb-1">Programming Languages</span>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
          <li>C</li>
          <li>C++</li>
          <li>Java</li>
          <li>Python</li>
          <li>SystemVerilog</li>
          <li>JavaScript</li>
          <li>TypeScript</li>
          <li>RISC-V</li>
          <li>Inline Assembly</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="mb-5">
        <span class="text-l font-bold block mb-1">OS &amp; Office Tools</span>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Linux / Unix</li>
          <li>Windows</li>
          <li>macOS</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="mb-5">
        <span class="text-l font-bold block mb-1">Design</span>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Figma</li>
          <li>Affinity Designer</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="mb-5">
        <span class="text-l font-bold block mb-1">Languages</span>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
          <li>German (native)</li>
          <li>English (CEFR C1)</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
</BaseLayout>
